rs in product companies. I work on architecture, teams, hiring and delivery, and at my largest, 56 people reported up to me. Recently: Coinbase&#x27;s app infrastructure, D-ID&#x27;s app built from zero, and Curvinha, my own product.</p></section><section><h2>Experience</h2><article class="resume-entry"><h3><span>Fractional CTO &amp; Engineering Consultant</span><span class="resume-date">2025 to Present</span></h3><p class="resume-org">Independent</p><ul><li>Architecture reviews and large migrations for product companies. Client details under NDA.</li><li>Interim engineering lead while clients hire: rituals, code review standards and the hiring loop.</li><li>AI work: reinforcement learning (RL) training environments and evaluations for AI models.</li></ul></article><article class="resume-entry"><h3><span>Senior Software Engineer</span><span class="resume-date">Mar 2024 to Dec 2025</span></h3><p class="resume-org">Coinbase · G2i</p><ul><li>Helped with the app&#x27;s large migrations on Consumer App Infra: React Native&#x27;s new architecture, React Compiler, Expo Prebuild and the design system.</li><li>Supported app releases and raised test coverage on team-owned files from 25% to 45%.</li></ul></article><article class="resume-entry"><h3><span>Lead Mobile Engineer</span><span class="resume-date">Sep 2023 to Feb 2025</span></h3><p class="resume-org">D-ID · A.Team</p><ul><li>Built the company&#x27;s new core product, its mobile app, from zero with React Native and Expo.</li><li>4.6 stars from 3.4K App Store ratings. Golden Kitty 2023 on Product Hunt, Best UX 2023 at A.Team.</li></ul></article><article class="resume-entry"><h3><span>Senior Software Engineer</span><span class="resume-date">Oct 2022 to Dec 2023</span></h3><p class="resume-org">Kustomer · Meta</p><ul><li>Built the open-source design system and SDKs for developers integrating with Kustomer&#x27;s APIs.</li></ul></article><article class="resume-entry"><h3><span>Senior Software Engineer</span><span class="resume-date">Apr 2022 to Sep 2023</span></h3><p class="resume-org">Groundswell · X-Team</p><ul><li>Raised test coverage from 30% to 80%+ with MSW and made the Discover page 200% faster.</li><li>Founded the Mobile Engineering Biweekly forum.</li></ul></article><article class="resume-entry"><h3><span>Software Engineer III</span><span class="resume-date">Sep 2020 to Apr 2022</span></h3><p class="resume-org">Zé Delivery · AB InBev</p><ul><li>Rebuilt the Browse module and shipped deep-link handling that lifted campaign conversion.</li><li>Co-wrote Mozeic, the in-house design system (177k+ npm downloads), and interviewed engineering candidates.</li></ul></article><article class="resume-entry"><h3><span>Mobile Engineer</span><span class="resume-date">Oct 2019 to Sep 2020</span></h3><p class="resume-org">Alfred Delivery</p><ul><li>As the only engineer, led the migration from Ionic to React Native for an app serving 90+ franchises.</li></ul></article><article class="resume-entry"><h3><span>Software Engineer</span><span class="resume-date">Apr 2017 to Oct 2019</span></h3><p class="resume-org">Micro Import Group</p><ul><li>Built a real-time repair-status tracker and internal dashboards for an Apple Service Provider.</li></ul></article></section><section><h2>Projects &amp; Open Source</h2><article class="resume-entry"><h3><span>Curvinha</span><span class="resume-date">2026 to Present</span></h3><p class="resume-org">Founder<!-- --> · <a href="https://curvinha.app">curvinha.app</a></p><p>Native iPhone app (SwiftUI, RoomPlan, RealityKit): scan a room, get a furnished plan with real products and the shopping list. On the App Store since Oct 2026.</p></article><article class="resume-entry"><h3><span>Pegada</span><span class="resume-date">2023 to Present</span></h3><p class="resume-org">Founder<!-- --> · <a href="https://github.com/GSTJ/pegada">github.com/GSTJ/pegada</a></p><p>Dog dating app for iOS and Android, built with Expo and React Native. #2 Product of the Day on Product Hunt, open source since 2025.</p></article><article class="resume-entry"><h3><span>Open source</span><span class="resume-date">2022 to Present</span></h3><p class="resume-org">Maintainer<!-- --> · <a href="https://github.com/GSTJ">github.com/GSTJ</a></p><p>magic-modal, eslint-plugin-safe-jsx, react-native-code-push-plugin and more: 347k+ npm downloads and 714 GitHub stars.</p></article></section><section><h2>Skills</h2><ul class="resume-skills"><li><strong>Leadership<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->Engineering management, Technical hiring, Mentoring, Roadmaps, Remote teams</li><li><strong>Engineering<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->App architecture, Migrations, Design systems, Testing, CI/CD, Developer experience</li><li><strong>Stack<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->TypeScript, React, React Native, Expo, Next.js, Node.js, Swift, SwiftUI</li><li><strong>AI<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->RL training environments, Model evaluation, AI agents</li><li><strong>Languages<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->English, Portuguese (native)</li></ul></section><section><h2>Talks</h2><ul class="resume-list"><li><span><strong>Eficiência com IA</strong>,<!-- --> <!-- -->The Brooklyn Brothers<!-- -->, <!-- -->São Paulo</span><span class="resume-date">2024</span></li><li><span><strong>Shipping Mozeic at Zé Delivery</strong>,<!-- --> <!-- -->TDC · Design Systems<!-- -->, <!-- -->São Paulo</span><span class="resume-date">2024</span></li><li><span><strong>Forming a Tech Lead, three days at a time</strong>,<!-- --> <!-- -->Assemble · Rocketseat<!-- -->, <!-- -->Remote</span><span class="resume-date">2023</span></li></ul></section><section><h2>Awards</h2><ul class="resume-list"><li><span><strong>Global Legal Hackathon SP</strong>,<!-- --> <!-- -->1st place</span><span class="resume-date">2020</span></li><li><span><strong>Mão na Cevada</strong>,<!-- --> <!-- -->1st place</span><span class="resume-date">2019</span></li></ul></section></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script data-cfasync="false" src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudfla